00:05:01,659 --> 00:05:02,541
Angle two.

152
00:05:02,721 --> 00:05:03,754
The psychology.

153
00:05:03,934 --> 00:05:06,582
Six mindset shifts that matter more than

154
00:05:06,582 --> 00:05:07,046
