163
00:05:19,325 --> 00:05:22,494
Many people with average incomes build wealth.

164
00:05:22,674 --> 00:05:24,892
Many people with high incomes don't.

165
00:05:25,072 --> 00:05:26,546
The difference is behavior.

166
00:05:26,897 --> 00:05:28,859
The proof is everywhere once you look.

167
00:05:29,039 --> 00:05:32,308
Thomas Stanley's research on millionaires found many

168
