187
00:06:09,933 --> 00:06:11,256
Shift three.

188
00:06:11,436 --> 00:06:13,909
From comparison, to your own scoreboard.

189
00:06:14,089 --> 00:06:15,503
On an average salary,

190
00:06:15,503 --> 00:06:17,860
