229
00:07:30,889 --> 00:07:32,328
The system does it for you.

230
00:07:32,679 --> 00:07:34,304
Here's something surprising.

231
00:07:34,484 --> 00:07:35,418
In some ways,

232
00:07:35,418 --> 00:07:37,862
