250
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:18,084
and average earners often have more of

251
00:08:18,084 --> 00:08:18,261
it.

252
00:08:18,611 --> 00:08:20,736
There's one more quiet advantage.

253
00:08:20,916 --> 00:08:23,208
When your lifestyle is built on an

254
00:08:23,208 --> 00:08:26,107
