273
00:09:02,591 --> 00:09:03,309
investments.

274
00:09:03,489 --> 00:09:04,882
This takes about an hour.

275
00:09:05,062 --> 00:09:07,338
It's the foundation of everything else.

276
00:09:07,687 --> 00:09:09,859
Then calculate your current savings rate.

277
00:09:10,039 --> 00:09:11,693
If it's zero or negative,

278
00:09:11,693 --> 00:09:13,481
