901
00:29:26,109 --> 00:29:27,781
Progress beats perfection.

902
00:29:28,131 --> 00:29:29,188
Objection two.

903
00:29:29,368 --> 00:29:30,819
The market could crash.

904
00:29:30,999 --> 00:29:31,910
Yes, it will,

905
