several times over a thirty five year

906
00:29:34,503 --> 00:29:34,993
career.

907
00:29:35,173 --> 00:29:38,777
Historically, broad stock markets have recovered from

908
00:29:38,777 --> 00:29:40,001
every major crash,

909
00:29:40,001 --> 00:29:42,313
though some recoveries took years.

910
00:29:42,493 --> 00:29:45,543
For a long term investor still contributing

911
00:29:45,543 --> 00:29:48,096
every month, a crash means buying at

912
00:29:48,096 --> 00:29:49,018
