930
00:30:24,885 --> 00:30:25,164
Good.

931
00:30:25,344 --> 00:30:26,191
So do I.

932
00:30:26,371 --> 00:30:28,403
This plan is not about living like

933
00:30:28,403 --> 00:30:28,821
