934
00:30:29,001 --> 00:30:32,069
Fifteen percent saved means eighty five percent

935
00:30:32,069 --> 00:30:32,461
spent.

936
00:30:32,641 --> 00:30:35,427
The sample budget includes real fun money.

937
00:30:35,607 --> 00:30:36,988
The goal is balance:

938
00:30:36,988 --> 00:30:38,922
a good life now and a secure

939
00:30:38,922 --> 00:30:41,546
life later, instead of trading one for

940
00:30:41,546 --> 00:30:42,236
