941
00:30:42,586 --> 00:30:43,805
Objection five.

942
00:30:43,985 --> 00:30:45,297
I'm too far behind.

943
00:30:45,477 --> 00:30:48,124
Whether you're thirty five with nothing saved

944
00:30:48,124 --> 00:30:49,652
or fifty with very little,

945
00:30:49,652 --> 00:30:51,475
the best time to start is still

946
00:30:51,475 --> 00:30:51,828
today.

947
00:30:52,008 --> 00:30:54,168
Every year you invest is a year

948
00:30:54,168 --> 00:30:55,212
that compounds.

949
00:30:55,392 --> 00:30:58,041
And remember the catch up contributions and

950
00:30:58,041 --> 00:30:59,026
Social Security.

951
00:30:59,206 --> 00:31:01,566
Starting late is harder than starting early,

952
00:31:01,566 --> 00:31:03,711
but it's far better than never starting.

953
00:31:04,060 --> 00:31:05,454
And objection six.

954
00:31:05,634 --> 00:31:07,596
