960
00:31:19,781 --> 00:31:21,363
One fund, chosen once,

961
00:31:21,363 --> 00:31:23,449
contributed to automatically.

962
00:31:23,629 --> 00:31:25,036
For many average earners,

963
00:31:25,036 --> 00:31:25,824
that's enough.

964
00:31:26,173 --> 00:31:27,532
And objection seven.

965
00:31:27,712 --> 00:31:28,919
I don't trust the system.

966
00:31:29,099 --> 00:31:32,226
Some people worry about Social Security,

967
00:31:32,226 --> 00:31:34,649
