968
00:31:34,829 --> 00:31:36,245
Those are fair concerns.

969
00:31:36,425 --> 00:31:38,571
That's part of why the plan uses

970
00:31:38,571 --> 00:31:41,454
diversified, low cost funds rather than any

971
00:31:41,454 --> 00:31:44,270
single company, keeps an emergency fund in

972
00:31:44,270 --> 00:31:45,946
insured savings accounts,

973
00:31:45,946 --> 00:31:49,231
and spreads money across different account types.

974
00:31:49,411 --> 00:31:51,051
You don't need to trust any one

975
00:31:51,051 --> 00:31:52,267
institution completely.

976
00:31:52,447 --> 00:31:54,492
You build a plan that doesn't depend

977
00:31:54,492 --> 00:31:56,139
on a single point of failure.

978
00:31:56,319 --> 00:31:58,200
And you keep reviewing it every year

979
00:31:58,200 --> 00:31:59,245
