993
00:32:23,201 --> 00:32:24,386
Day three.

994
00:32:24,566 --> 00:32:27,259
Log into your workplace retirement plan.

995
00:32:27,439 --> 00:32:29,437
Check the match formula and make sure

996
00:32:29,437 --> 00:32:31,596
