1015
00:32:59,682 --> 00:33:01,192
Keep it where you'll see it.

1016
00:33:01,372 --> 00:33:03,123
That's your fuel for the next thirty

1017
00:33:03,123 --> 00:33:03,415
years.

1018
00:33:03,764 --> 00:33:04,566
Quick recap.

1019
00:33:04,746 --> 00:33:06,101
On an average salary,

1020
00:33:06,101 --> 00:33:09,070
fifteen percent invested for thirty five years

1021
00:33:09,070 --> 00:33:11,330
